{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Papiro API","description":"Papiro REST API. Authentication: an `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header with a token created in Settings → API tokens (or with `POST /api/tokens`). The web interface uses a session cookie.\n\nRoles: `viewer` can only read; `editor` uploads and edits; `admin` can also manage users and webhooks and delete permanently. A token can be read-only.\n\nErrors always return `{\"error\": \"message\"}` with the matching HTTP status code.\n\nFor AI agents there is also an MCP server (Streamable HTTP) at `/mcp` that accepts the same token.","license":{"name":"MIT","identifier":"MIT"},"version":"0.5.0"},"paths":{"/api/audit":{"get":{"tags":["system"],"summary":"Audit log (admin)","description":"Who did what and from which IP: logins, uploads, edits, deletions and administration changes.","operationId":"list_audit","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuditEntry"}}}}}}}},"/api/auth/login":{"post":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Log in (cookie)","description":"Limit: 10 attempts every 5 minutes per IP address (`429`). The limit is per connection, not per\nuser: nobody can lock someone else out by getting their password wrong.","operationId":"auth_login","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Credentials"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthUser"}}}},"401":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"429":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"503":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}},"security":[{}]}},"/api/auth/logout":{"post":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Log out","operationId":"auth_logout","responses":{"204":{}}}},"/api/auth/password":{"post":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Change your own password (signs out your other sessions)","operationId":"auth_password","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PasswordChange"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"204":{},"401":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/auth/setup":{"post":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Create the initial administrator account","description":"Only works while no user exists.","operationId":"auth_setup","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Credentials"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthUser"}}}},"409":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}},"security":[{}]}},"/api/auth/status":{"get":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Session status","operationId":"auth_status","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthStatus"}}}}},"security":[{}]}},"/api/correspondents":{"get":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"list_correspondents","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["labels"],"description":"`match` + `algo` define automatic assignment on ingest: `any` (any of the words),\n`all` (all of them), `literal` (exact phrase), `regex`; `none` turns it off.","operationId":"create_correspondent","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LabelInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}},"409":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/correspondents/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"delete_correspondent","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"204":{},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"update_correspondent","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LabelInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/doctypes":{"get":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"list_doctypes","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["labels"],"description":"`match` + `algo` define automatic assignment on ingest: `any` (any of the words),\n`all` (all of them), `literal` (exact phrase), `regex`; `none` turns it off.","operationId":"create_doctype","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LabelInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}},"409":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/doctypes/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"delete_doctype","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"204":{},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"update_doctype","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LabelInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents":{"get":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Search and list documents","description":"Full-text search (SQLite FTS5, ranked by BM25 relevance) combined with filters.\nWithout `q` it returns the list sorted by date. Only includes what the user can see.","operationId":"list_documents","parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","description":"Text to search for (full-text). Supports \"quoted phrases\"; the last word matches as a prefix.","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"tags","in":"query","description":"Comma-separated tag IDs; the document must have all of them","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"correspondent","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}},{"name":"doctype","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}},{"name":"folder","in":"query","description":"Folder, including its subfolders. `0` = documents with no folder","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}},{"name":"from","in":"query","description":"Earliest document date (YYYY-MM-DD)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"to","in":"query","description":"Latest document date (YYYY-MM-DD)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"expiring","in":"query","description":"Only documents that have expired or expire within the next 60 days (sorted by expiry date)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}},{"name":"inbox","in":"query","description":"Only documents with an inbox tag","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}},{"name":"trash","in":"query","description":"Show the trash instead of the active documents","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}},{"name":"sort","in":"query","description":"relevance | created | added | modified | title | asn | expires","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"order","in":"query","description":"asc | desc","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","description":"At most 200 (default 50)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DocList"}}}},"401":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Upload documents","description":"Stores the files and queues them for extraction/OCR. Responds `202` right away with the jobs;\nwith `?wait=true` it waits for the result and responds `201` with the documents. Duplicates (same\nSHA-256) are not stored again: the job ends as `duplicate`, pointing at the existing document.\nAn unsupported file type is rejected with `415` and nothing is queued. If a job fails, the\nfile is kept and can be retried with `POST /api/jobs/{id}/retry`.","operationId":"upload_documents","parameters":[{"name":"wait","in":"query","description":"Wait until processing finishes and return the created documents","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UploadForm"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Processed (wait=true)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UploadResult"}}}},"202":{"description":"Queued","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UploadResult"}}}},"400":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"415":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"507":{"description":"Out of disk space","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/bulk":{"post":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Bulk edit","description":"Applies the same fields as `PATCH /api/documents/{id}` to all the `ids`, or runs an action\n(`trash`, `restore`, `purge`; the last one is for administrators only). All or nothing.","operationId":"bulk_edit","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BulkEdit"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Affected"}}}},"403":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Read a document (metadata, full text and notes)","operationId":"get_document","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Document"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Move to the trash (or delete permanently)","operationId":"delete_document","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}},{"name":"permanent","in":"query","description":"Delete permanently (row and files) instead of moving to the trash. Administrators only.","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}}],"responses":{"204":{},"403":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Edit a document","description":"Only the fields sent are changed. `null` in `correspondent_id`, `doctype_id`, `asn` or `summary` clears them.","operationId":"update_document","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DocPatch"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Document"}}}},"403":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{id}/ai":{"post":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Classify and summarize with AI","description":"Sends the text to the configured LLM (`PAPIRO_LLM_*`) and applies the suggested title, summary, correspondent, type,\ntags and date. Responds `501` if no LLM is configured.","operationId":"document_ai","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Document"}}}},"501":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"502":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{id}/file":{"get":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Download the file","description":"Supports range requests (`Range`).","operationId":"document_file","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}},{"name":"variant","in":"query","description":"`original` (what was uploaded) or `archive` (PDF with a text layer). Default: archive if it exists.","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"download","in":"query","description":"Force a download instead of displaying it in the browser","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"File contents","content":{"application/octet-stream":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","minimum":0}}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{id}/notes":{"post":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Add a note","operationId":"add_note","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/NoteInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Note"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{id}/pages/{page}":{"get":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Page rendered as an image (JPEG, 1400 px wide)","description":"This is what the preview uses: it works the same in every browser, including on phones.\nAvailable for PDFs and images (any document with an original or archive PDF).","operationId":"document_page","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}},{"name":"page","in":"path","description":"Page number, starting at 1","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","minimum":0}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"JPEG image","content":{"image/jpeg":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","minimum":0}}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{id}/restore":{"post":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Restore from the trash","operationId":"restore_document","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Document"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{id}/suggest":{"post":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Local analysis suggestions","description":"Papiro analyzes every document without anything leaving the server: rules detect the expiry date, the amount,\nthe CURP and the RFC, and it proposes a folder, type, correspondent and tags by similarity to what is already filed.\nThis endpoint accepts or dismisses the pending suggestions, or requests a fresh analysis.","operationId":"document_suggest","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SuggestAction"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Document"}}}},"400":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/documents/{id}/thumb":{"get":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Thumbnail of the first page (JPEG)","description":"If it does not exist yet (imported documents), it is generated on the first request and stored.","operationId":"document_thumb","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"JPEG image","content":{"image/jpeg":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","minimum":0}}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/events":{"get":{"tags":["queue"],"summary":"Live events (Server-Sent Events)","description":"Each message is JSON: `{\"type\":\"job\",\"job\":{…}}` or `{\"type\":\"document.created|updated|deleted|purged\",\"id\":N}`.","operationId":"events","responses":{"200":{"description":"SSE stream","content":{"text/event-stream":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}}}},"/api/folders":{"get":{"tags":["folders"],"summary":"List folders","description":"Every folder, sorted by path. `document_count` counts what is in the folder and in its subfolders.","operationId":"list_folders","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Folder"}}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["folders"],"summary":"Create a folder","operationId":"create_folder","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FolderInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Folder"}}}},"400":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"409":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/folders/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["folders"],"summary":"Delete a folder","description":"Deletes the folder and its subfolders. Documents are not deleted: they move to the parent folder\n(or end up with no folder if it was at the root).","operationId":"delete_folder","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"204":{},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["folders"],"summary":"Rename or move a folder","operationId":"update_folder","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FolderInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Folder"}}}},"400":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"409":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/jobs":{"get":{"tags":["queue"],"summary":"Last 100 ingest jobs","operationId":"list_jobs","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Job"}}}}}}}},"/api/jobs/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["queue"],"summary":"Status of an ingest job","operationId":"get_job","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Job"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["queue"],"summary":"Dismiss a finished job","description":"If it had failed, the file that was kept is deleted too.","operationId":"dismiss_job","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"204":{},"400":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/jobs/{id}/retry":{"post":{"tags":["queue"],"summary":"Retry a failed job","description":"The file of a failed job is kept (`can_retry` field); this queues it again.","operationId":"retry_job","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Job"}}}},"400":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/notes/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["documents"],"summary":"Delete a note","operationId":"delete_note","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"204":{},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/stats":{"get":{"tags":["queue"],"summary":"Archive and queue totals","operationId":"get_stats","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Stats"}}}}}}},"/api/status":{"get":{"tags":["system"],"summary":"System status (admin)","operationId":"get_status","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Status"}}}}}}},"/api/tags":{"get":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"list_tags","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["labels"],"description":"`match` + `algo` define automatic assignment on ingest: `any` (any of the words),\n`all` (all of them), `literal` (exact phrase), `regex`; `none` turns it off.","operationId":"create_tag","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LabelInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}},"409":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/tags/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"delete_tag","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"204":{},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["labels"],"operationId":"update_tag","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LabelInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Label"}}}},"404":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/tokens":{"get":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"List your own API tokens","operationId":"list_tokens","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TokenInfo"}}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Create an API token","description":"The token value (`ppr_…`) only appears in this response; the server stores only its hash.\nA viewer can only create read-only tokens.","operationId":"create_token","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TokenInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TokenInfo"}}}},"403":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/tokens/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Revoke an API token","operationId":"delete_token","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"204":{}}}},"/api/users":{"get":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"List users (admin)","operationId":"list_users","responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthUser"}}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Create a user (admin)","operationId":"create_user","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserInput"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthUser"}}}},"409":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}}},"/api/users/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Delete a user (admin)","description":"Their documents are kept (left without an owner; private ones become visible to administrators only).","operationId":"delete_user","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"204":{},"400":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Change a us